<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset the Second Breakfast password for
  <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>. Use the link below to choose a new one:
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Reset my password", edit_password_reset_url(token: @token) %>
</p>

<p>This link can only be used once and expires in <%= @expires_in %>.</p>

<p>If you didn't ask for this, you can safely ignore this email — your password will not change.</p>
